  "detail": "`call` retries 5xx and transport errors without limit while heartbeats keep renewing the lease. Reproduction (Codex): persistent 503s for the bundle download with real loopback heartbeats, and the coordinator clock advanced 20 s per heartbeat. After 800 s the job is still leased at attempt 1, so it never gets another worker or the local fallback. Fix (Every pending state ends): give each job one deadline (for example the gate timeout plus setup and transfer margin). The worker posts a failure when it passes, and the coordinator stops renewing a lease past it and moves the job on. One deadline, not a second retry layer. Test with the 503 reproduction."
 },
